abstract: "Open research package for China's global green compute and cross-border AI Token delivery study, containing the full 12-chapter Chinese Markdown manuscript, English executive summary, 76 catalogued CSV tables (59 processed research tables in data/processed/ + 17 reproducible model tables in data/models/), 43 report exhibit table snapshots in data/exhibits/, 4 parameter JSON files in data/parameters/, 56 figures (PNG + SVG) in figures/, and reproduction code in src/ and tools/. Original code is licensed under MIT; report manuscripts, figures, and metadata are under CC BY-NC 4.0; IEA-derived tables/series remain under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (see LICENSES/LICENSE-SCOPE.md)."
